li>You should know better than to be an enemy of the Marid</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Part of the <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a>. \n<b>Note:</b> The mission rewards are given before facing this boss, but he must be fought before you can re-take the task.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (0-130)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Fireball</span> (210-250)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Heavy Magic Missile</span> (100-300)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Electrified\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Electrifying Berserk</span> (25 hp for 3 turns)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Summons\"><img alt=\"Summons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Player_Summon_dc8280.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span> Summons</span> (1-3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Djinn\">Blue Djinn</a>)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Self-Healing</span> (173?-?)</div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:86.9565%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 13.0435%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.1000\" title=\"Death\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Death <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Cursed Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"l