and run circles.\n<b>Knights</b> should charge the boss and slay it as quickly as possible using exori/exori grans, because again, the summons can make things difficult.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 57 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\"><img alt=\"Blue Piece of Cloth\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Piece_of_Cloth_5ae3aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Blue Piece of Cloth</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-4</td>\n<td>1.5</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Jewelled Belt\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jewelled_Belt_1ed442.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Jewelled Belt</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Go